  m_Name: DB_BossPressureActionDeck_PocketReview
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: DimensionBrawl.Runtime::DimensionBrawl.Combat.BossPressureActionDeckProfile
  deckId: PocketReviewBoss
  globalRecoverySeconds: 1.1
  decisionThinkIntervalSeconds: 0.25
  actionSlots:
  - Pattern: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 25cd6927b39e10048ab562c4e150cb3a, type: 2}
    ActionKind: 4
    MinimumTier: 1
    QueuedWaves: 1
    MinimumIntervalSeconds: 4.2
    ResponseId: DodgeBossLinePressureSpecial
    StageLoopRole: LV1 boss special shot that asks the player to read a committed rail before spending summon resources.
    PlayerAnswer: Strafe or dodge out of the rail, then punish with ranged fire when the lane is clear.
    SummonAnswer: No summon is required; save SummonSlot1 for boss-side summon pressure.
    UsePlayerForwardRiskGate: 0
    MinimumPlayerForwardRisk01: 0
    MaximumPlayerForwardRisk01: 1
    UsePlayerSummonResponseGate: 0
    MinimumPlayerSummonTier: 1
    SelectionPriority: 15
    ForwardRiskPriorityBonus: 0
    SummonResponsePriorityBonus: 0
    MovementIntent: 2
  - Pattern: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 732ffa1eae726f14386a4a02115611c9, type: 2}
    ActionKind: 1
    MinimumTier: 1
    QueuedWaves: 1
    MinimumIntervalSeconds: 3.8
    ResponseId: LaserSoldierDodgeLine
    StageLoopRole: LV1 laser-soldier summon pressure that shows the dodge-line read before any LV2/LV3 bank is needed.
    PlayerAnswer: Watch the thin aim line, dodge after the lock, then punish while the rifleman recovers.
    SummonAnswer: A low-tier summon can body-clash the rifleman, but the intended read is movement first.
    UsePlayerForwardRiskGate: 0
    MinimumPlayerForwardRisk01: 0
    MaximumPlayerForwardRisk01: 1
    UsePlayerSummonResponseGate: 0
    MinimumPlayerSummonTier: 1
    SelectionPriority: 5
    ForwardRiskPriorityBonus: 0
    SummonResponsePriorityBonus: 0
    MovementIntent: 4
  - Pattern: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 732ffa1eae726f14386a4a02115611c9, type: 2}
    ActionKind: 1
    MinimumTier: 2
    QueuedWaves: 1
    MinimumIntervalSeconds: 4.2
    ResponseId: SummonSlot1PressureBlock
    StageLoopRole: LV2 summon-pressure exchange that answers the player's heavy SUMMON with an immediate boss-side body screen.
    PlayerAnswer: Spend SUMMON deliberately; expect the boss to answer with a visible pressure body before the punish window opens.
    SummonAnswer: The player summon should clash with the boss screen, break the curtain, and reopen ranged punish time.
    UsePlayerForwardRiskGate: 0
    MinimumPlayerForwardRisk01: 0
    MaximumPlayerForwardRisk01: 1
    UsePlayerSummonResponseGate: 1
    MinimumPlayerSummonTier: 2
    SelectionPriority: 30
    ForwardRiskPriorityBonus: 0
    SummonResponsePriorityBonus: 140
    MovementIntent: 4
  - Pattern: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 732ffa1eae726f14386a4a02115611c9, type: 2}
    ActionKind: 1
    MinimumTier: 3
    QueuedWaves: 1
    MinimumIntervalSeconds: 7.5
    ResponseId: LaserSoldierDodgeLine
    StageLoopRole: LV3 laser-soldier summon pressure that turns stored boss cost into a readable dodge line instead of another body block.
    PlayerAnswer: Watch the thin aim line, dodge after the lock, then punish while the laser soldier recovers.
    SummonAnswer: A prepared summon can body-screen the lane, but the intended read is movement first and summon only as a backup.
    UsePlayerForwardRiskGate: 0
    MinimumPlayerForwardRisk01: 0
    MaximumPlayerForwardRisk01: 1
    UsePlayerSummonResponseGate: 0
    MinimumPlayerSummonTier: 1
    SelectionPriority: 35
    ForwardRiskPriorityBonus: 0
    SummonResponsePriorityBonus: 0
    MovementIntent: 4
  - Pattern: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b5e71e44209f74394f56e232db8d78, type: 2}
    ActionKind: 2
    MinimumTier: 3
    QueuedWaves: 1
    MinimumIntervalSeconds: 6
    ResponseId: RetreatOrSpendHighTierAnswer
    StageLoopRole: LV3 overextend punish that closes gaps when the player stays near the forward boundary too long.
    PlayerAnswer: Retreat from forward-risk space or dodge through the shrinking net before firing back.
    SummonAnswer: A prepared high-tier summon screen can buy the follow-up window, but it should cost the player's stored EN.
    UsePlayerForwardRiskGate: 1
    MinimumPlayerForwardRisk01: 0.66
    MaximumPlayerForwardRisk01: 1
    UsePlayerSummonResponseGate: 0
    MinimumPlayerSummonTier: 1
    SelectionPriority: 80
